<codeline lineno="7"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>TopKinematicsSelection_intro<sp/>Introduction</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="8"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>The<sp/>`TopKinematics`<sp/>class,<sp/>implemented<sp/>in<sp/>Cython,<sp/>is<sp/>a<sp/>specialized<sp/>selection<sp/>template<sp/>within<sp/>the<sp/>AnalysisG<sp/>framework,<sp/>designed<sp/>for<sp/>comprehensive<sp/>analysis<sp/>of<sp/>top<sp/>quark<sp/>kinematics<sp/>in<sp/>Monte<sp/>Carlo<sp/>16<sp/>(MC16)<sp/>events.<sp/>It<sp/>inherits<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>generic<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`<sp/>class,<sp/>extending<sp/>its<sp/>functionalities<sp/>to<sp/>extract<sp/>and<sp/>organize<sp/>detailed<sp/>information<sp/>about<sp/>resonant<sp/>and<sp/>spectator<sp/>top<sp/>quark<sp/>kinematics<sp/>(energy,<sp/>eta,<sp/>phi,<sp/>pT),<sp/>as<sp/>well<sp/>as<sp/>mass<sp/>and<sp/>Delta-R<sp/>(dR)<sp/>combinations.<sp/>This<sp/>class<sp/>facilitates<sp/>a<sp/>high-performance<sp/>extraction<sp/>and<sp/>structuring<sp/>of<sp/>top<sp/>quark<sp/>kinematic<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>further<sp/>physics<sp/>analysis.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="9"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="10"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@section<sp/>TopKinematicsSelection_helper_functions<sp/>Helper<sp/>Functions<sp/>(Python-style,<sp/>Cython-optimized)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="11"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>These<sp/>functions<sp/>are<sp/>designed<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>used<sp/>as<sp/>callbacks<sp/>for<sp/>`self.root_leaves`<sp/>in<sp/>`SelectionTemplate`,<sp/>processing<sp/>data<sp/>as<sp/>it&apos;s<sp/>read<sp/>from<sp/>ROOT<sp/>files.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="12"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="13"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`def<sp/>res_data(zp,<sp/>data)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="14"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>Processes<sp/>kinematic<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>&quot;resonant&quot;<sp/>top<sp/>quarks.<sp/>It<sp/>extracts<sp/>the<sp/>kinematic<sp/>variable<sp/>(energy,<sp/>eta,<sp/>phi,<sp/>or<sp/>pT)<sp/>from<sp/>`data[1]`<sp/>and<sp/>appends<sp/>it<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>corresponding<sp/>list<sp/>in<sp/>`zp.res_top_kinematics`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="15"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>@param<sp/>zp<sp/>An<sp/>instance<sp/>of<sp/>`TopKinematics`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="16"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>@param<sp/>data<sp/>A<sp/>tuple<sp/>`(name_string,<sp/>list_of_floats)`<sp/>where<sp/>`name_string`<sp/>indicates<sp/>the<sp/>kinematic<sp/>variable<sp/>and<sp/>`list_of_floats`<sp/>contains<sp/>the<sp/>values.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="17"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="18"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>-<sp/>`def<sp/>spec_data(zp,<sp/>data)`:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="19"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>Processes<sp/>kinematic<sp/>data<sp/>for<sp/>&quot;spectator&quot;<sp/>top<sp/>quarks.<sp/>Similar<sp/>to<sp/>`res_data`,<sp/>but<sp/>appends<sp/>to<sp/>`zp.spec_top_kinematics`.</highlight></codeline>
