<codeline lineno="21"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>@param<sp/>data<sp/>A<sp/>tuple<sp/>`(name_string,<sp/>list_of_floats)`<sp/>containing<sp/>the<sp/>data.</highlight></codeline>
