<codeline lineno="40"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Initializes<sp/>several<sp/>internal<sp/>Python<sp/>attributes<sp/>(`res_top_kinematics`,<sp/>`spec_top_kinematics`,<sp/>`mass_combi`,<sp/>`deltaR`)<sp/>to<sp/>`None`.<sp/>These<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>dynamically<sp/>populated<sp/>as<sp/>data<sp/>is<sp/>processed<sp/>by<sp/>the<sp/>helper<sp/>functions.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="41"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/><sp/><sp/>-<sp/>Initializes<sp/>a<sp/>new<sp/>C++<sp/>`topkinematics`<sp/>object<sp/>and<sp/>assigns<sp/>its<sp/>pointer<sp/>to<sp/>`self.ptr`.<sp/>It<sp/>then<sp/>upcasts<sp/>`self.ptr`<sp/>to<sp/>a<sp/>`topkinematics*`<sp/>and<sp/>assigns<sp/>it<sp/>to<sp/>`self.tt`<sp/>for<sp/>specialized<sp/>access.</highlight></codeline>
